cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or mention claude-nonstop, please cite it as below."
title: claude-nonstop
abstract: >-
  A free, open-source tool that keeps Claude Code, Codex and the Claude desktop app
  working through usage limits. When a subscription hits its session or weekly limit,
  it moves your work to your next account, then to your API keys, one by one.
type: software
